# C1-PREP — cloud-synthetic profile. The one disclosed, deliberate choice this profile
# makes that case1/case2 didn't need to: TZ=UTC by default (docs/C1_HOST_CONTRACT.md §4),
# not a reproduction of either existing case. No PAPER_DATA_DIR (resolves under the
